tationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000717 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1364>)\n\n  Line 10064: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000727 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1930>)\n\n  Line 10071: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000728 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1930>)\n\n  Line 10078: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000729 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1930>)\n\n  Line 18036: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0002371 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1150>)\n\n  Line 23022: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0008029 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1540>)\n\n  Line 23031: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0008030 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1540>)\n\n  Line 23410: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:31350390\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3163-0115\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0009013 \"A progenitor cell with hepatic and biliary lineage potential, identified in mouse and human, and anatomically restricted to the ductal plate of fetal liver.\")\n\n  Line 23474: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29449449\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3163-0115\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0009019 \"A kidney cortical cell that is part of the nephrogenic zone.\")\n\n  Line 24525: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0010003 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/2429>)\n\n  Line 25196: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0017501 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/734>)\n\n  Line 25233: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0017505 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/2251>)\n\n  Line 25720: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0020026 \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3